<title>UK: Tesco sets 250 million stg 10-year bond. [CORRECTED 09:40 GMT]</title>
<headline>Tesco sets 250 million stg 10-year bond. [CORRECTED 09:40 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TESCO PLC (Corrects from Tesco Co Ltd)</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN STG   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    30.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    30.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.35	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+45 BP</p>
<p> NOTES   ** TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> IBCA	 AA-	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  UK	  TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.20	SELL CONC  0.15	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.25 PCT 2007 GILT</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
